        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/a88e4f/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-07-31T05:07:07.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Arcanist Lupus\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n Arcanist Lupus:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>Medic-Tank wrote:</b><br><blockquote>You really have to let things get out of hand to get such results the win usually becomes impossible by your own fault...\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nI believe that the proper term is <a href=\"http://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/UnwinnableByInsanity\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Unwinnable by Insanity</a>.\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>For example, someone following a link to tvtropes even though they know it will be many hours before they can extract themselves from its labyrinthine coils…</p>",
